{"id":169,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Its hind limbs have become another set of wings. Crobat expertly maneuvers its four wings to dart in exquisite fashion through even the most confined caves without losing any speed."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon flaps its four wings skillfully. Crobat can fly through cramped caves without needing to slow down."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Both of its legs have turned into wings. Without a sound, Crobat flies swiftly toward its prey and sinks its fangs into the nape of its target’s neck."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It feeds on the blood of living people and Pokémon. If it can’t drink any blood for even a short while, it becomes weak and unable to fly."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its fangs are so sharp, if it bites you in the dark and sucks your blood, you won’t notice any pain or realize you’ve been bitten."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Silent and swift in its four-winged flight, it bites down on its prey before they realize what’s happening. In a heartbeat, it drains their blood."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Both its legs became wings, and as a result, it can’t move well on the ground. All it can do is crawl around."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Crobat sneaks up on its intended prey using wings that barely make a sound. This Pokémon rests by hanging on a tree branch with its rear legs that serve as wings."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"If this Pokémon is flying by fluttering only a pair of wings on either the forelegs or hind legs, it’s proof that Crobat has been flying a long distance. It switches the wings it uses if it is tired."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Having four wings allows it to fly more quickly and quietly so it can sneak up on prey without its noticing."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It flies so silently through the dark on its four wings that it may not be noticed even when nearby."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The transformation of its legs into wings made it better at flying, but more clumsy at walking."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"The development of wings on its legs enables it to fly fast but also makes it tough to stop and rest."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"A Pokémon that gained vastly enhanced flying performance by having its legs turn into wings."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Inner Focus","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's intense focus prevents it from flinching or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"cave","color":"Purple","shape":"Bug wings","evolution":{"id":41,"name":"Zubat","condition":null,"children":[{"id":42,"name":"Golbat","condition":"Lv. 22","children":[{"id":169,"name":"Crobat","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[0,440],[1,48],[1,71],[1,92],[1,103],[1,212],[1,310],[1,366],[15,305],[20,501],[27,314],[34,44],[41,114],[48,474],[55,109],[62,403],[69,141]],"machine":[512,97,403,372,213,413,440,242,399,203,263,19,202,416,257,506,542,63,141,417,371,182,240,156,496,103,247,214,188,173,211,164,241,129,269,168,369,253,599,474,404,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[814]},"cards":[{"id":"me4-93","name":"Crobat","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"93","artist":"Kazuhisa Uragami","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-93/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-93/large"},{"id":"me55c-47","name":"Crobat G","set":"30th Celebration: Classic Collection","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"47","artist":"Makoto Imai","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55c-47/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55c-47/large"},{"id":"me4-51